   "type": "box",
   "title": "📝 Quick Summary:",
   "html": "As per HDFC Bank’s interest rate structure effective <strong>19 August 2026</strong>, regular customers can earn between <strong>2.75% and 6.50% p.a.</strong> on domestic deposits below ₹3 crore. Eligible resident senior citizens receive an additional <strong>0.50 percentage points</strong> on applicable tenures, taking the maximum rate to <strong>7.10% p.a.</strong> The highest regular-customer rate of 6.50% p.a. applies to deposits with a tenure of <strong>3 years 1 day to less than 4 years 7 months</strong>.",
