  {
   "type": "p",
   "html": "HDFC Bank offers fixed deposits across a range of tenures and deposit amounts, with separate interest rates for regular customers and eligible resident senior citizens. Since FD rates can change, the applicable rate should be checked on the date the deposit is booked. Here’s a complete breakdown of HDFC Bank’s FD interest rates as of October 2026 (effective August 19, 2026), along with the factors you should weigh before locking in your money."
  },
